                    {
                        "sense_id": "7335c21b-67f0-317d-8abc-c03bf6b888c1",
                        "entry_id": "776c1afd-3c3e-3fa5-ad02-28f37d333f2e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A pervasive neurological condition that is observable in early childhood and persists throughout the lifespan, characterised by atypical communication patterns (e.g., differences in body language or eye contact), delayed language development, and sensory processing sensitivities."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "192b899c-b8e5-46eb-8fa3-d5ae481323c7",
                                "sense_id": "7335c21b-67f0-317d-8abc-c03bf6b888c1",
                                "text": "Mostly, the microbiome is beneficial. It helps with digestion and enables people to extract a lot more calories from their food than would otherwise be possible. Research over the past few years, however, has implicated it in diseases from atherosclerosis to asthma to autism."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d6036847-3337-3e7d-84f1-3df3268819a1",
                        "entry_id": "776c1afd-3c3e-3fa5-ad02-28f37d333f2e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A pervasive neurological condition that is observable in early childhood and persists throughout the lifespan, characterised by atypical communication patterns (e.g., differences in body language or eye contact), delayed language development, and sensory processing sensitivities.",
                            "Synonym of autism spectrum; a range of disorders."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
